{"title":"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> in the equation:  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/7/16799bd6e950e5f8968b66e4308f5d8b6490f3ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}(a^2 - 15a) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"19\" /> are:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/6/ff65b839a940ae2d8b1f707f1b399a66167280c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac {15\\pm\\sqrt {233}}{2} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 20, - 5 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac {15 \\pm \\sqrt {305}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"390\" height=\"41\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/7/ec7175d4bb45d9bf15a560d301373b670d930e29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\pm20 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"236\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Putting into exponential form, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/b/a4b280227b866d553a18d2227f56774c1fbe2af9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^2=a^2-15a\\Rightarrow a^2-15a-100=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"297\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Now we use the quadratic formula to solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, and we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/2/5b2dbbc777b1a47e99be9cc801cb1bc6e16e383b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\frac{15\\pm\\sqrt{625}}{2}\\implies a=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 20, - 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"299\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME\" title=\"1951 AHSME\">1951 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1951 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1951\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 2